  "answer_text": "Here's a roundup of the **best laptop deals online right now** across various categories and budgets:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Best Laptop Deals Online (June 2026)\n\n### \ud83d\uded2 Where to Shop\nYou can find all kinds of deals across a wide range of online retailers such as **Newegg, Walmart, Best Buy, Amazon**, and more. It's also worth checking out deals directly from laptop manufacturers like **Lenovo, HP, and Dell**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcbb Top Picks by Category\n\n#### \u2705 Best Overall / Premium Laptop\nThe **Lenovo Yoga** stands out as one of the best Windows laptops right now \u2014 it features a **14-inch 2880\u00d71800 OLED display** with HDR at up to 120Hz, an **Intel Core Ultra 7 258V CPU**, **32GB RAM**, and **1TB SSD storage** with Intel Arc 140V graphics. It weighs under three pounds, offers up to **23 hours of battery life**, and its **2-in-1 form factor** lets you flip it all the way around for tablet or tent mode.\n\n#### \ud83c\udfae Best Gaming Laptop Deals\n- The **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G16** features a **16\" 2.5K OLED 240Hz display**, **Intel Core Ultra 9 285H**, **16GB RAM**, and an **NVIDIA RTX 5070** with 1TB SSD.\n- There's also a notable deal on an **RTX 5060 Lenovo gaming laptop** featuring an OLED display, Ultra 7 chipset, 32GB of RAM, with **$400 off**.\n\n#### \ud83d\udcb0 Best Budget Laptop\nThe **Dell 15 Laptop** is a great affordable option, powered by an **AMD Ryzen 3 7320U** chip \u2014 well-suited for daily tasks like browsing, streaming, and email.\n\n#### \ud83c\udf10 Best Chromebook Deals\nAffordable Chromebook options include the **Acer Chromebook 315** (15.6\" FHD, MediaTek Kompanio 540, 4GB RAM) and the **Lenovo Chromebook Plus** (15.3\" 2K Touchscreen, Intel Core 3 Processor N355, 8GB RAM, 128GB UFS).\n\n#### \ud83c\udf4e Best MacBook Deals\nYou can currently **save up to $300 on the Apple MacBook Air**, with deals available on both the **M4 and M5** models.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd25 Hottest Deals Right Now\nSome of the biggest savings include:\n- A **14\" laptop with Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD** for **$649**\n- A **14\" laptop with Core Ultra 7 255H + RTX 5060** for **$1,099** (down from $2,599 \u2014 saving **$1,500**)\n- A **16\" laptop with RTX 5070, Ryzen AI 7, 32GB RAM** for **$1,389** (down from $1,649 \u2014 saving **$260**)\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Buying Tips\n- Aim for **at least 8GB of RAM** (16GB is preferable if you game), and avoid laptops with under **4GB RAM** or **128GB SSD storage**.\n- **Chromebooks** make great everyday machines for browsing and email \u2014 they use fewer resources and are generally **more affordable** than Windows laptops.\n- A **Windows laptop** is far more versatile and can be upgraded with more RAM and storage for power users.\n\n---\n\nFor the latest, up-to-date deals, check out these top sources:\n- \ud83d\udd17 [PCWorld Laptop Deals](https://www.pcworld.com/article/550968/best-laptop-deals-3.html)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [Best Buy Laptop Sales](https://www.bestbuy.com/site/all-computers-tablets-on-sale/laptops-on-sale/pcmcat1720704669400.c)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [TechRadar Best Laptop Deals](https://www.techradar.com/news/the-best-laptop-deals)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [HP Weekly Laptop Deals](https://www.hp.com/us-en/shop/slp/weekly-deals/laptops)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [BestLaptop.deals](https://www.bestlaptop.deals/)",
